cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "Research prototype and preprint draft, not a universal raw-CV fairness certificate."
title: "Native-Token-Count Name-Channel Noninterference with Authenticated Role Review"
authors:
  - family-names: Mansour
    given-names: Adel
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-11-03
type: software
url: "https://github.com/adelmansourjr/racial-bias-ai-calibration"
license: MIT
abstract: >-
  Canonical retained evidence is tokenized internally after the complete original
  source is embedded, giving exact native evidence token counts. Two credential
  endorsements and registered-reference checks strengthen annotation provenance
  and omission rejection without proving universal semantic role correctness.
